        1934,
        1917,
        2116
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Triborough Bridge and Tunnel Authority, by resolution adopted on June 19, 1972, has elected, subject to the approval of the Mayor to continue such increased-take-home-pay-plan during the City's 1972-1973 fiscal year; and",
